@startuml explicit-sequence-diagram-name-example
skinparam boxPadding 100
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam noteTextAlignment center
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign direction
skinparam wrapWidth 250
autonumber

title Explicit sequence diagram name example

actor "Alice\n(user)" as alice
actor "Bob\n(user)" as bob

note over alice, bob
  This is a simple sequence diagram with an explicit name example.
end note

alice -> bob: Hello Bob, how are you?
bob -> alice: Hi Alice, I'm good thanks! How about you?
alice -> bob: I'm doing well too, thanks for asking!

@enduml
